// v4.0 — fully featured companion plugin:
//   !k        instant knife type -> skin chain with auto best seed + FN wear + visual refresh
//   !ws       instant skin menu for held weapon with auto best seed + FN wear + visual refresh
//   !gloves   instant gloves menu (all glove types/skins in one list)
//   !seed N   manually override paint seed on held weapon
//   !bestseed apply the best-known seed for the held weapon's current paint
//   !wear F   set wear/float of held weapon to F (e.g. !wear 0.001 = FN, !wear 0.5 = Battle-Scarred)
//   !fn       shorthand for !wear 0.000001
//
// DB triggers in best_seeds_setup.sql automatically apply the best seed + FN wear
// when any wp_player_skins row's paint_id changes.

